<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bond futures end higher before expiry.</title>
<headline>Swiss bond futures end higher before expiry.</headline>
<text>
<p>1630 GMT - Swiss debt futures end higher as U.S. and German bonds strengthed after release of U.S. data during the European afternoon. March contracts expire on Monday. * March Conf futures end up 21 basis points at 120.50 * 4-1/2 pct June 2007 bond yields 3.591 pct vs 3.585 pct</p>
<p>(Full details/background follow)</p>
